# Hosted MyEmulator2 Linux needs the software floating-point helpers used by
# musl's printf/scanning and math code.  The freestanding target deliberately
# excludes these helpers; this hosted fragment does not.
# Hosted MyEmulator2 Linux uses GCC's generic DWARF2 unwinder. The target
# compiler must therefore provide the normal libgcc exception runtime instead
# of inheriting the freestanding target's empty LIB2ADDEH overrides.
